cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus or benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "forecast-answer-formats: a cross-tool benchmark of forecasting-bot answer extractors"
abstract: >-
  A public labeled corpus comparing which valid LLM answer formats two deployed
  forecasting-bot extractors (mv2-forecaster and Metaculus forecasting-tools)
  read versus silently drop, and when they misread reasoning text as a spurious
  forecast, across all three Metaculus question types: binary, multiple-choice,
  and numeric (percentile).
type: dataset
authors:
